an> <span begin="00:24.131" end="00:24.682">somethin'</span> <span begin="00:24.682" end="00:24.998">'bout</span> <span begin="00:24.998" end="00:25.237">his</span> <span begin="00:25.237" end="00:25.992">manners</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="00:25.526" end="00:26.093"><span begin="00:25.526" end="00:25.784">(Uh-</span><span begin="00:25.784" end="00:26.093">huh)</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">他的一举一动别有意味</span></p><p begin="00:26.093" end="00:27.855" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:26.093" end="00:27.036">Havana,</span> <span begin="00:27.036" end="00:27.252">ooh-</span><span begin="00:27.252" end="00:27.552">na-</span><span begin="00:27.552" end="00:27.855">na</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="00:27.238" end="00:27.589"><span begin="00:27.238" end="00:27.589">(Uh)</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">哈瓦那 哦呐呐</span></p><p begin="00:27.589" end="00:29.869" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:27.589" end="00:27.699">He</span> <span begin="00:27.699" end="00:27.962">didn't</span> <span begin="00:27.962" end="00:28.109">walk</span> <span begin="00:28.109" end="00:28.348">up</span> <span begin="00:28.348" end="00:28.497">with</span> <span begin="00:28.497" end="00:28.677">that</span> <span begin="00:28.677" end="00:28.914">"how</span> <span begin="00:28.914" end="00:29.246">you</span> <span begin="00:29.246" end="00:29.869">doin'?"</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="00:30.161" end="00:30.287"><span begin="00:30.161" end="00:30.287">(Uh)</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">他没有走来问“你好吗”</span></p><p begin="00:30.666" end="00:32.475" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:30.666" end="00:30.958">When</span> <span begin="00:30.958" end="00:31.198">he</span> <span begin="00:31.198" end="00:31.533">came</span> <span begin="00:31.533" end="00:31.750">in</span> <span begin="00:31.750" end="00:32.020">the</span> <span begin="00:32.020" end="00:32.475">room</span><