</span> <span begin="00:40.007" end="00:40.674">summer</span> <span begin="00:40.674" end="00:40.975">night</span> <span begin="00:40.975" end="00:41.213">in</span> <span begin="00:41.213" end="00:41.562">June</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那个六月的夏夜</span></p><p begin="00:40.972" end="00:43.706" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="00:40.972" end="00:41.215">And</span> <span begin="00:41.215" end="00:41.579">papa</span> <span begin="00:41.579" end="00:41.900">says</span> <span begin="00:41.900" end="00:42.115">he</span> <span begin="00:42.115" end="00:42.413">got</span> <span begin="00:42.413" end="00:42.972">malo</span> <span begin="00:42.972" end="00:43.246">in</span> <span begin="00:43.246" end="00:43.706">him</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="00:43.803" end="00:44.008"><span begin="00:43.803" end="00:44.008">(Uh)</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">爸爸说他身上有股邪气</span></p><p begin="00:44.387" end="00:45.813" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="00:44.387" end="00:44.649">He</span> <span begin="00:44.649" end="00:44.985">got</span> <span begin="00:44.985" end="00:45.236">me</span> <span begin="00:45.236" end="00:45.539">feelin'</span> <span begin="00:45.539" end="00:45.813">like...</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">可他让我感觉……</span></p><p begin="00:45.813" end="00:48.702" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="00:45.813" end="00:46.711">Ooh,</span> <span begin="00:46.711" end="00:47.008">ooh-</span><span begin="00:47.008" end="00:47.285">ooh-</span><span begin="00:47.285" end="00:47.542">ooh-</span><span begin="00:47.542" end="00:47.861">ooh-</span><span begin="00:47.861" end="00:48.166">ooh-</span><span begin="00:48.166" end="00:48.421">ooh-</span><span begin="00:48.421" end="00:48.702">ooh</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="00:48.789" end="00:48.965"><span begin="00:48.789" end="00:48.965">(Ayy)</span></span></p><p begin="00:48.965" end="00:53.262" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1